        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(hooks): bound hook workspace manifest and HOOK.md reads",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`readRootFileUtf8` in `src/hooks/workspace.ts` reads hook `package.json` and `HOOK.md` files with an unbounded `fs.readFileSync` call. A malicious or runaway file in a hook directory could force workspace discovery to buffer an arbitrarily large file into memory, leading to OOM.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nBoth `package.json` and `HOOK.md` are small metadata files. A 1 MiB cap each is generous headroom for legitimate hook documentation and manifests while preventing workspace discovery from being used as a memory exhaustion vector.\n\n## User Impact\n\nWorkspace hook discovery now silently skips hook packages with oversized manifests or `HOOK.md` files instead of buffering them into memory.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Added regression tests for oversized `package.json` and oversized `HOOK.md` in a hook directory, asserting the hooks are skipped.\n- Local focused run: `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/hooks/workspace.test.ts --run` passes (9/9 tests).\n",
        "branch": "fix/bound-hook-workspace-file-reads",
